  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電磁波",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTROMAGNETIC WAVE",
    "describe_ch": "介紹時變電磁場的相關原理及應用為主，包含了馬克斯威爾(Maxwell)方程式，平面波的傳播，反射及透射，傳輸線原理及天線，波導及輻射系統的應用等。",
    "describe_eh": "Introduction to time varying fields including Maxwell's Equations and plane wave propagation,reflection and transmission,waves and pulses on transmission lines；applications to antennas,guided waves,and radiating systems.",
